# DuCoPA Independent Kill Switch -- target allowlist (copy to
# security/state/killswitch/config/targets.conf, mode 0600).
# One line per permitted containment: action|target_id|environment
# Only the three test actions and environment=test are accepted; any
# other line makes the whole file invalid and every command is refused.
revoke_test_session|test-session-001|test
block_test_endpoint|test-endpoint-api|test
isolate_test_worker|test-worker-echo|test
